  "prompt": "Cho hình chóp tứ giác đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có tất cả các cạnh đều bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>. Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khoảng cách từ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> tới mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mi>m</mi></msqrt></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></semantics></math>. Tính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.",
